  "_comment": "cloud-ci-tier-field-coverage gate policy (DATA, not code). Phase-0 capability-first reorg (ADR-0562 closed capability registry + ADR-0536 substrate decision matrix + ADR-0245 tier-as-manifest-facet). The enums are sourced VERBATIM from specs/platform-architecture.json microservice_taxonomy.tier_enum + tier_subtype_enum (the authoritative canonical lists); governed_service_roots are the live service trees that MUST carry the per-service tier triple. de_overload_denied_tier_values are the DR/reliability + deployment-mode vocabularies that MUST NOT appear in the dependency-class `tier` field (type-overload guard): T0..T3 are the dr_tier vocabulary; saas/surface/sse/hot/fallback/self-hosted are the deployment_mode vocabulary; the historical loose value `external-facing` is also denied (superseded by product-developer-* subtypes). dr_tier_enum is the DR/reliability class kept DISTINCT from `tier`. min_expected_service_manifests is the live-corpus floor (guards a silently-broken scan / CWD against a false-green). Born pack-shaped: an adopting repo repoints governed roots + enums and the kernel runs unchanged.",
